# Coding style (C# under `src/`)

For ConfigureAwait, `.Internal` / `[EntityFrameworkInternal]`, resx errors, NativeAOT, and API baseline (and other shared conventions), follow [`.github/copilot-instructions.md`](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md) — do not restate them here.

For the required `.Internal` / `[EntityFrameworkInternal]` XML doc-comment boilerplate on every member, copy from [`src/EFCore/Metadata/Internal/ClrCollectionAccessor.cs`](../../src/EFCore/Metadata/Internal/ClrCollectionAccessor.cs).

## This rule only (omitted from copilot-instructions)

- **License header** — every new `.cs` file starts with the .NET Foundation header, copied verbatim from a sibling file:

```csharp
// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.
// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.
```

- **File-scoped namespaces** — `namespace X.Y.Z;` (not block-scoped).
- **One type per file** — do not add a second top-level type to an existing file.
